nkings. Add your Friends to follow along as they expand their Fleets, and watch Fleeters fly through Global and Friends feeds.\n\nPurchasing the Fleet Enthusiast subscription removes the 2-year flight history limit, unlocking flight history back to 2011. It also removes the 20-plane direct-add limit and raises the monthly flight replay limit from 5 to 100.\n\nTerms of Use (EULA): https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/", "languageCodesISO2A": ["EN"], "fileSizeBytes": "94911488", "formattedPrice": "무료", "trackContentRating": "4+", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion": 5, "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion": 2, "trackCensoredName": "Fleet: Planes You’ve Flown", "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/kr/app/fleet-planes-youve-flown/id6756808430?uo=4", "contentAdvisoryRating": "4+", "averageUserRating": 5, "minimumOsVersion": "15.1", "trackName": "Fleet: Planes You’ve Flown", "trackId": 6756808430, "genres": ["여행", "유틸리티"], "artistName": "FLEET APP LLC", "userRatingCount": 2}]}